# Licenses for osbxl-samples

> **[🇯🇵 日本語版ライセンスはこちら (LICENSE.ja.md)](LICENSE.ja.md)**

This repository (`osbxl-samples`) contains code samples, patterns, and AI skills for the OSBXL spreadsheet calculation engine.
Please note that different licensing terms apply to the sample code and the OSBXL software engine itself.

